# Never invent

This project forbids invention. Absence is unpublished, never a filled-in fact.

Do not invent contacts, volumes, brands in the book, last purchase, stock, sales, exclusivity, import, employee count, or intent to buy.

Do not fill gaps from training memory, typical distributors, similar countries, or what a company like this would usually do.

A trade dump, Atlas line, or RAG neighbor is never a Kanechom or LQ purchase. RAG similarity is a past dashboard profile. A RAG neighbor is a different company — do not copy its contacts, brands, or purchases onto this lead.

If a field is not in the candidate cards, cited URLs, page extracts, or the RAG line, leave it empty or write unpublished.

When editing prompts, keep `evidenceRule()` as the first sentence of every Exa, Firecrawl, OpenAI, Parallel, dump-similar, and diligence instruction. Put `ragLine(lead)` on every OpenAI and Parallel candidate card.
